  ($q$cs-91$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 1, $q$Text 1: Sleep researcher A argues that blue light from screens before bed is the primary cause of shortened sleep duration in teenagers, citing survey data linking screen time to later bedtimes.

