  ($q$cs-109$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 2, $q$The telescope's new sensor proved remarkably ______, detecting light from galaxies too faint for any previous instrument to register.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["sensitive","dull","expensive","outdated"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Detecting light 'too faint for any previous instrument to register' describes a highly sensitive sensor, not a dull one.$q$, null),
  ($q$cs-110$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 2, $q$Critics described the sculptor's latest work as ______, since it used the exact same bronze-casting method she had employed for the past twenty years.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["stagnant","innovative","abstract","collaborative"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Using 'the exact same...method' for twenty years without change describes a stagnant body of work, the opposite of innovative.$q$, null),
  ($q$cs-111$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 2, $q$The band's sound grew increasingly ______ over the decade, incorporating synthesizers, horn sections, and orchestral strings into songs that once featured only guitar and drums.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["elaborate","minimalist","quiet","repetitive"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Adding synthesizers, horns, and orchestral strings to once-simple arrangements describes an increasingly elaborate sound, not a minimalist one.$q$, null),
